{"id":"n71130-1-12","stage":1,"title":"이곳 · 这里","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71130-1-12-1","ko":"이곳 생활은 좀 어떠십니까?","zh":"您在这里的生活感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생활은","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"1","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠십니까?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"人或动物在一定的地方活下去。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ff3fdaa8db2098fc8fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71130-1-12-2","ko":"네, 공기도 좋고 조용해서 좋아요.","zh":"嗯，空气好又安静，我很喜欢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text"